cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ReliableML in your research, please cite this software."
title: ReliableML
abstract: >-
  ReliableML is a Python library for building and assessing machine-learning
  systems with distribution-shift monitoring, labeled model evaluation,
  fairness metrics, model-deterioration analysis, meta-learning classifiers,
  model-agnostic explanations, and statistical reason audits.
